From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 04:54:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add GST registration toggle + location-accuracy note to
 field-add form
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Referenced against a competitor field-sales app's Customers table
(Registration Type column, location pin). Adds an optional
Registered/Unregistered toggle to both "+ Add New Dealer" forms
(Dashboard and Check-In tab), surfaced to admin in the submissions
queue as a badge. Also adds an explicit caution line next to the
location capture — GPS was already being taken silently from wherever
the rep is standing when they tap Add; now it's called out so the rep
is reminded they need to actually be at the shop, not just anywhere.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GxWPdEf21EL6SvRpGBbX8q
